            </a>
            <a href="/pricing" class="bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg inline-block">
              Rental Options &amp; Quotes
            </a>
            <a href="/emergency-surveillance" class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg inline-block">
