          <a href="/blog/trailhead-car-prowls-western-washington-recreation-security" class="block bg-white rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Trailhead Car Prowls in Western Washington</h3>
